OL,3,GNEWSAEx-wife of Tommy Robinson avoids
OL,4,Ajail in loan case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ex-wife of political activist Tommy
OL,7,FRobinson has avoided jail after she
OL,8,Ffailed to give liquidators information
OL,9,Fabout a #396,630 loan owed to her
OL,10,Fcompany.
OL,12,FJenna Lennon, 41, from Bedfordshire,
OL,13,Fpleaded guilty to one charge of failing
OL,14,Fto deliver up books and records about
OL,15,Fher company, Hope & Pride Limited,
OL,16,Fbetween 22 September 2023 and 1
OL,17,FDecember 2025.
OL,19,FThe lack of information about the loan
OL,20,Fmeant liquidators were unable to verify
OL,21,Fthe "explanations and figures" around
OL,22,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
