OL,3,GNEWSAEx-wife of Tommy Robinson avoids
OL,4,Ajail in loan case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother-of-three had claimed she was
OL,7,Ftoo dependent on an accountant and was
OL,8,F"disorganised with public records", her
OL,9,Fsolicitor advocate David Rosen told
OL,10,FSouthwark Crown Court on Thursday.
